  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Song clan specially nurtured him. Since becoming a wisdom path Gu Immortal he has sat on the cliff of twin polar sea strait, using a special wisdom path inheritance to fuse with the world. The clan asks him to deduce upcoming fortunes on important matters. In Eastern Sea he is one of the three publicly recognized most capable wisdom path Gu Immortals. The saying goes that Jia Dan sits in twin polar, Hua An hides in Nan Gong, and Dragon Head Tortoise lives inside adversity sea.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_song_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "char_hua_an",
        "fac_nan_gong_clan",
        "char_dragon_head_tortoise"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He needs Song Qi Yuan’s command token before he will deduce. After taking Song Yi Shi’s Gu worms he cannot deduce Xing Xiang Zi’s location. He names two possible reasons: the target is not in Eastern Sea, or the target has wisdom path techniques that conceal them, or help from another wisdom path Gu Immortal. He refuses a second attempt because the clan must obtain Old Eccentric Tian Nan’s inheritance and he needs to preserve his strength.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_qi_yuan",
        "char_song_yi_shi",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "inh_tian_nan_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He stays on the cliff of twin polar sea strait. His upper body is already old and weak. His lower body has been petrified, and his legs seem to have fused with the strait. His face is hard like a statue. His muscles are stiff and can show no expression. He speaks slowly and with difficulty.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A later speaker ranks him highest among Eastern Sea’s three best wisdom path experts, and says he sacrificed himself for his clan and fused himself into the world of Eastern Sea. As long as it is within Eastern Sea, that speaker says, he can deduce accurately.",
      "chapters": [
        903
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "highest-of-three",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He sits beside the cliff with his eyes shut. His lower body is encased in grey stone. His upper body has the appearance of an old man, extremely wrinkled and very aged. The method costs him his freedom. When his lifespan runs out he would turn to stone completely and lose all life.",
      "chapters": [
        987
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "grey-stone",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
